{"4091570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chaos Hero", "steam_appid": 4091570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The core gameplay of <i>Chaos Hero</i> is easy to learn.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong><br>You only need to move your character using the directional keys or analog stick, navigating through a dense barrage of projectiles and endless hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression</strong><br>Defeating monsters causes them to drop experience gems. Collect them to level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, you can select one enhancement from a randomly generated set of options, including passive skills and stat upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Challenge</strong><br>Your goal is to survive the onslaught. Enemies grow increasingly dense as time progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, your journey begins as a desperate struggle for survival. Through continuous choices and evolution, you will eventually grow into a powerful hero, capable of tearing through thousands of enemies.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The core gameplay of <i>Chaos Hero</i> is easy to learn.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong><br>You only need to move your character using the directional keys or analog stick, navigating through a dense barrage of projectiles and endless hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression</strong><br>Defeating monsters causes them to drop experience gems. Collect them to level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, you can select one enhancement from a randomly generated set of options, including passive skills and stat upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Challenge</strong><br>Your goal is to survive the onslaught. Enemies grow increasingly dense as time progresses.</p><p cl